{"v":2,"s":"m","w":6,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"Monomials and polynomials","b":"<p>A <b>monomial</b> (monom) is a product of a number and variables: 3x², −5ab. A <b>polynomial</b> (polinom) is a sum of monomials: 2x² − 3x + 1.</p><p><b>Like terms</b> (slični monomi) have the same variables with the same powers. Only like terms can be added.</p><p>The <b>degree</b> (stepen) is the highest power: 4x³ − x + 7 has degree 3.</p><div class=\"callout\">Sorting fruit: you can only add apples to apples — x² with x², x with x.</div>"},{"t":"read","h":"Adding and multiplying","b":"<p>To add or subtract, remove the brackets and combine like terms. A <b>minus before a bracket flips every sign inside</b>: −(2a − b) = −2a + b.</p><p>To multiply, multiply each term by each term:</p><div class=\"fx\">(x + 2)(x + 3) = x² + 3x + 2x + 6 = x² + 5x + 6</div><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 168\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"(x + 2)(x + 3) as an area: one x², five strips x, six unit squares → x² + 5x + 6.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"40\" y=\"10\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"60\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\">x²</text><rect x=\"132\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"90\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\">x</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"90\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\">x</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"10\" width=\"20\" height=\"90\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\">x</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"102\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"116\" font-size=\"11\">x</text><rect x=\"132\" y=\"102\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"116\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"10\">1</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"102\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"116\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"10\">1</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"102\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"116\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"10\">1</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"124\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"a2\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"11\">x</text><rect x=\"132\" y=\"124\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"142\" y=\"138\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"10\">1</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"124\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"138\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"10\">1</text><rect x=\"176\" y=\"124\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" rx=\"0\" class=\"mu\"/><text x=\"186\" y=\"138\" class=\"on\" font-size=\"10\">1</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"160\" font-size=\"12\">x + 3</text><text x=\"20\" y=\"110\" font-size=\"12\" transform=\"rotate(-90 20 110)\">x + 2</text></svg><figcaption>(x + 2)(x + 3) as an area: one x², five strips x, six unit squares → x² + 5x + 6.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"ex","q":"(3x² − 2x + 1) − (x² + 4x − 5)","s":["Remove brackets, flipping signs in the second: 3x² − 2x + 1 − x² − 4x + 5.","Combine: 3x² − x² = 2x², −2x − 4x = −6x, 1 + 5 = 6."],"a":"2x² − 6x + 6"},{"t":"mc","q":"2x + 3x = ?","o":["5x","5x²","6x","6x²"],"a":0,"e":"Like terms: add the coefficients."},{"t":"mc","q":"(x + 2)(x + 3) = ?","o":["x² + 6","x² + 5x + 6","x² + 6x + 5","2x + 5"],"a":1,"e":"x² + 3x + 2x + 6."},{"t":"mc","q":"−(2a − b) = ?","o":["−2a − b","−2a + b","2a + b","2a − b"],"a":1,"e":"Flip every sign inside."},{"t":"num","q":"Value of 2x² − 3x + 1 at x = 2?","a":3,"u":"","e":"8 − 6 + 1 = 3."},{"t":"num","q":"Degree of 4x³ − x + 7?","a":3,"u":"","e":"Highest power is 3."}]}